# Canonized in Blood ({1}{B} enchantment): "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control" (CR 603.4, 700.11, 115.1).
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts it with Memnite and Ornithopter, but no permanent card reaches its graveyard: no trigger at its end step, nothing grows. On turn 2 Bot2 puts its own Memnite in play.
# On turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices a Black Lotus (a permanent card into its graveyard: it descended); at its end step the trigger targets one of its own creatures (Bot2's Memnite is refused: the
# opponent's creature is no legal target) and only the chosen Ornithopter gets a counter, 0/2 -> 1/3.
